  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品展示框</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 徹底重設計了物品展示框，讓它們比以往更快、更具反應性且更實用。🚀</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不再依賴實體，物品展示框變為輕量化的方塊，效能大幅提升，特別是在包含大量展示框的建築中。它們能即時對世界變化做出反應，支援正確的方塊互動，並包含原版物品展示框所缺乏的多項便利性改進功能。⚡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了效能提升，本模組還提供了強大的自訂選項。將展示框染成數百萬種顏色 🎨、隱藏框架本身以單獨展示物品 🫥、用蜂巢塗蠟封鎖展示框以防意外更改 🍯，以及微調隱形展示框的外觀，使其完美契合您的建築與資源包。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">方塊化物品展示框：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 物品展示框以方塊形式實作而非實體，大幅提升了效能。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">減少延遲，提升 FPS：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 渲染與更新速度大幅加快，在展示框密集區域可顯著提升 FPS。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更佳互動體驗：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 包含正確的破壞粒子效果，並完全相容於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">/setblock</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 等指令。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚡ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">即時反應：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 當支撐方塊被破壞或活塞推動時，展示框會立即作出反應。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✅ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">單一方塊多展示框：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 依然支援多個物品展示框佔據同一個方塊空間。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">數百萬種顏色：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 像染色皮革盔甲一樣為物品展示框上色，解鎖 5,713,438 種獨特顏色。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🫥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">隱形展示框：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 手持空手按住 Shift 鍵並右鍵點擊，即可隱藏框架本身，同時使顯示的物品比平常更大。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">塗蠟展示框：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用蜂巢鎖定物品展示框，防止意外旋轉、修改或改變可見性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選命名牌隱藏：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 觀看展示物品時，可防止自訂物品名稱浮現。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">世界轉換選項：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 載入區塊時，可選擇將現有的原版物品展示框實體轉換為展示框方塊。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援設定，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行配置（Fabric 版需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具體取決於設定類型。並非所有類型都會存在於每個模組中。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MehVahdJukaar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 以其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-paintings\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fast Paintings</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組啟發了本專案。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/illager-invasion\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/visualworkbench/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
